				<img height="283" src="img/goliathus030_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/SO-TA/goliathus/img/goliathus030.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
